title: "Nigehban: Pakistan Multi-Hazard Risk Analyzer"
abstract: >-
  Explainable flood, heatwave, and seismic risk scoring for 150 Pakistani districts, built on real geography
  and synthetic climate data, with nested cross-validation, calibrated probabilities, SHAP explanations, a
  climate stress test, and verified accessibility.
